 addUserKnob {4 cs_splats_updatable_mode l Updatable t "Sets the updatable mode, they are:\n - Clear: Clears the Splat node and doesn't create a CsSplatSwap\n - Update: Keeps the nodes and sets the CsSplatSwap to update\n - Keep: Keeps the nodes only, CsSplatSwap node is set to not update" M {Clear Update Keep}}
