 addUserKnob {43 cs_sb_splats_exec_after l "Exec After" t "Code that is executed after the node is splatted.\nnuke.thisSplat() returns the Splats tab.\nnuke.thisSplatData() returns a data object with the newly created nodes.\n\n<b>splats_data.nodes</b> - list of all newly created nodes that were splatted.\n<b>splats_data.inputs</b> - a dictionary of imported node to node stack.\n<b>splats_data.outputs</b> - lists output nodes that all inputs are connected to.\n<b>splats_data.interfaces</b> - a dictionary from node to the version interface that was used to import the asset versions"}
